# KardbordBox project build configuration (prjconf)
#
# Scmsync writes this file as the project's build configuration
# (also known as the project config / prjconf). It is merged with
# the configurations of every project referenced in the repository
# <path> entries when a build runs.
#
# Build targets (repositories, paths, architectures) are NOT defined
# here. They live in the OBS project meta (home:Kardbord:KardbordBox),
# because scmsync does not sync project meta into the repository.
#
# No project-wide settings are required for spec/RPM builds, and the
# dsc/deb repositories (Ubuntu_26.04, Debian_13, Raspbian_13) are
# fully configured by the path projects (Ubuntu:26.04, Debian:13,
# Raspbian:13). Setting a global Type here would fight those configs,
# so leave it unset.
#
# Add overrides here, guarded per repository, when needed, e.g.:
#
#   %if "%_repository" == "openSUSE_Tumbleweed"
#   Macro: %my_macros 1
#   %endif
